# Default emulator per ES-DE system where ES-DE's own first choice is not
# shipped (or too slow on the Snapdragon 662): system|ES-DE emulator label.
# Written once into ~/ES-DE/gamelists/<system>/gamelist.xml; change it any time
# in ES-DE: Other settings -> Alternative emulators.
arcade|FinalBurn Neo
mame|MAME 2003-Plus
psx|PCSX ReARMed
ps2|PCSX2 (Standalone)
saturn|YabaSanshiro
pcengine|Beetle PCE FAST
pcenginecd|Beetle PCE FAST
atari5200|Atari800
n3ds|Citra
